      "portugal/lisbon-alfama-belem": {
        "name": "Lisbon Alfama, Belem and the trams",
        "description": "Hilltop castle neighbourhoods, tram 28, the Belem Tower and custard tarts.",
        "details": "Lisbon spreads over seven hills. Alfama has Sao Jorge Castle and fado bars, and tram 28 climbs the old lanes. Belem has the Jeronimos Monastery and the Belem Tower, plus Pasteis de Belem custard tarts. Wear flat, grippy shoes for the cobbles.",
        "interests": [
