      "portugal/algarve-lagos": {
        "name": "Algarve: Lagos, Ponta da Piedade and Benagil Cave",
        "description": "Golden sea cliffs, grottoes by boat or kayak and warm beaches.",
        "details": "Lagos has sea stacks and grottoes at Ponta da Piedade, reached by kayak or boat. Benagil Cave, a large sea cave with a skylight, is visited by small boat, subject to sea conditions and access rules. Beaches such as Praia do Camilo are down wooden steps.",
        "interests": [
